s.","context":"The Services and Brands We Market","section":"Business Overview","block":520,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-044131","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026044131/ea0281758-10k_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98.bin","sha256":"93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98"}},{"id":"c5ddfd4df177f368126c096a5822d73ad6d804e7c6ffaed09aedee9d2e1b52d4","quote":"The CWS Platform is an American online retailer specializing in selling alcohol products, striving to become the most trusted and convenient destination for online alcohol purchases. Combining the personalized service of a neighborhood alcohol shop with the efficiency of e-commerce, we offer a wide selection of products, including our exclusive brand, SWOL Tequila, all at competitive prices with fast shipping and around-the-clock convenience. At the heart of our brand is a commitment to exceptional customer service, driving us to continuously innovate our operations for an enhanced shopping experience. From user-friendly website navigation and a top-rated mobile app to detailed order tracking and personalized product recommendations, we are revolutionizing the online alcohol shopping experience, ensuring customer satisfaction remains paramount in all our endeavors.","context":"LQR House is an American online retailer of alcohol products.","section":"Business Overview","block":521,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-044131","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026044131/ea0281758-10k_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98.bin","sha256":"93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98"}},{"id":"a2ed0e25d50dce93b80d9635868d0eee0c5997aa4e731bc31ec633a165d8d5bf","quote":"The following products and services constitute the core elements of our business model and allow us to serve various types of customers in the alcohol industry, including individual consumers, wholesalers, and third-party alcohol brands:","context":"41","section":"Business Overview","block":523,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-044131","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026044131/ea0281758-10k_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98.bin","sha256":"93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98"}},{"id":"eb94c22883da4f8828f84305390bade0719fa0b0a7c212866809753c8ee295f4","quote":"●SWOL Tequila is a limited-edition blend of tequila made in exclusive batches of up to 10,000 bottles which was originally owned by Dollinger Innovations and transferred over to us pursuant to the Tequila Asset Purchase Agreement. Pursuant to the Tequila Asset Purchase Agreement, we purchased all of the right, title and interest in the trademarks SWOL and all associated trade dress and intellectual property rights and all labels, logos and other branding bearing the SWOL marks or any mark substantially similar to the same. Tequila bearing the “SWOL” trademark is produced by Casa Cava de Oro S.A., an authentic tequila distillery in Jalisco, Mexico, imported into the United States through Rilo Import & Export (“Rilo”) by Country Wine & Spirits LLC (“CWS”) and sold to retail customers in the United States via the CWS Platform and in CWS’s physical locations.","context":"The following products and services constitute the core elements of our business model and allow us to serve various types of customers in the alcohol industry, including individual consumers, wholesalers, and third-party alcohol brands:","section":"Business Overview","block":524,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-044131","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026044131/ea0281758-10k_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98.bin","sha256":"93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98"}},{"id":"236080dba0631cc7867fdc4af056fe0e02c21aa76866444bda846bc4e39c710d","quote":"●Vault is the exclusive membership program for the CWS Platform, which is offered and managed by the Company. We receive the subscriptions fees generated by this program. Through the CWS Platform, users can sign up for this exclusive membership where they will have access to all products available through CWS combined with special membership benefits.","context":"●SWOL Tequila is a limited-edition blend of tequila made in exclusive batches of up to 10,000 bottles which was originally owned by Dollinger Innovations and transferred over to us pursuant to the Tequila Asset Purchase Agreement. Pursuant to the Tequila Asset Purchase Agreement, we purchased all of the right, title and interest in the trademarks SWOL and all associated trade dress and intellectual property rights and all labels, logos and other branding bearing the SWOL marks or any mark substantially similar to the same. Tequila bearing the “SWOL” trademark is produced by Casa Cava de Oro S.A., an authentic tequila distillery in Jalisco, Mexico, imported into the United States through Rilo Import & Export (“Rilo”) by Country Wine & Spirits LLC (“CWS”) and sold to retail customers in the United States via the CWS Platform and in CWS’s physical locations.","section":"Business Overview","block":525,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-044131","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026044131/ea0281758-10k_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98.bin","sha256":"93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98"}},{"id":"1496321911426e1f52e8e65368f9eb0d6d60557650349ef3059997aa927575f8","quote":"●Soleil Vino will be a wine subscription service marketed on the CWS Platform that will offer a selection of vintage and limited production wines. Through the CWS Platform, users will be able to sign up for this exclusive membership where they will have access to curated selections of wine from around the world. With Soleil Vino, we intend to create a premium wine subscription service on the market with high qualities and diverse selections of wine offerings. Pursuant to an asset purchase agreement, dated May 31, 2021, between us and Dollinger Holdings LLC, we purchased all of the right, title and interest in all trademarks regardless of registration status for Soleil Vino and all associated trade dress and intellectual property rights, all labels, logos and other branding bearing the Soleil Vino marks or any mark substantially similar to the same, and all website and all related digital and social media content including but not limited to influencer networks, http://www.soleilvino.com, and all related content, and all related sales channels was transferred.","context":"●Vault is the exclusive membership program for the CWS Platform, which is offered and managed by the Company. We receive the subscriptions fees generated by this program. Through the CWS Platform, users can sign up for this exclusive membership where they will have access to all products available through CWS combined with special membership benefits.","section":"Business Overview","block":526,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-044131","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001843165","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1843165/000121390026044131/ea0281758-10k_lqrhouse.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98.bin","sha256":"93a3cd500156d73a7aef7ef4f9dd199efdeb0a08585ba1e8bd7c7bd1786d6b98"}},{"id":"5ebff70e385bf68a8cb316c663b55c898e67fa52f85fd0a81687d1f94f48b7cf","quote":"●LQR House Marketing is a marketing service in which we utilize our marketing expertise to help our wholly owned brands and third-party clients market their products to consumers. For example, by engaging us for our marketing services, our clients gain the ability to advertise and sell their brand on the CWS Platform.","context":"●Soleil Vino will be a wine subscription service marketed on the CWS Platform that will offer a selection of vintage and limited production wines. Through the CWS Platform, users will be able to sign up for this exclusive membership where they will have access to curated selections of wine from around the world. With Soleil Vino, we intend to create a premium wine subscription service on the market with high qualities and diverse selections of wine offerings. Pursuant to an asset purchase agreement, dated May 31, 2021, between us and Dollinger Holdings LLC, we purchased all of the right, title and interest in all trademarks regardless of registration status for Soleil Vino and all associated trade dress and intellectual property rights, all labels, logos and other branding bearing the Soleil Vino marks or any mark substantially simila